Description: The serialization mechanism of R allows to save and load R data
             objects in a binary format, that can however not be read easily
	     by other programming languages or software. The xcmsStash package
             implements the serialization methods from the MsStash package for
             result objects from the xcms Bioconductor package. Data can be
	     stashed in a variety of file formats and types, including HDF5 and
	     JSON-based formats defined by the Bioconductor *alabaster* package.
